{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/gif1.gif?t=1748878821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming and atmospheric third-person adventure game where you play as a red panda exploring a serene and mysterious forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No words, no combat, no rush \u2014 just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 <strong>An atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 Explore a forest full of gentle colors, natural sounds, hidden paths, and unexpected discoveries.<br> \ud83e\udded <strong>A story without words</strong> \u2014 Told through the environment, visual cues, and emotional tone.<br> \ud83e\udd8a <strong>Panda abilities</strong> \u2014 Climb trees, roll into a ball, jump, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> \ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> \u2014 Complete light, optional tasks that guide you subtly and expand the world.<br> \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> \u2014 No pressure or urgency, just total immersion.<br> \ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> \u2014 Drop in anytime for a calming forest walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/gif3.gif?t=1748878821\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771270?t=1748878821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/0def3b60d8a10d7af92099ae15cf1ff73260c51d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748878821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/1dd8d78